        "description": {
            "value": "<p>A Quincy's demon arts are <strong>Gint&#333;</strong> &mdash; small silver tubes of liquefied reiryoku, uncorked and spoken over, which is exactly what Kid&#333; is to a Soul Reaper.</p><p>You know <strong>two</strong> and they are always these: <strong>Heizen</strong>, your free cantrip, and <strong>Gritz</strong>. You cannot learn others, and no feat grants you more.</p><hr /><p><em>The third canon Gint&#333;, Sprenger, is not a kid&#333;: it needs five Seele Schneider planted in a pentacle, and it appears where canon puts it &mdash; at Ury&#363; Ishida's Final Release.</em></p>"
